# Drum classes new times and dates

We are back! New 5 week drumming courses start this coming Tuesday the 14th July. There are new times for the experienced drummers and the opportunity for beginner drummers to stay on and drum for the NEW dance class starting at 6.30pm for just an extra $4. These sessions will be led by Nathaniel and are a great opportunity for drummers to experience the traditional dances to each rhythm. Drumming is about dancing! So come and experience the real thing! This opportunity is only open to Rhythm Culture drumming students. **Starts July 14th every Tuesday night/$99 - 5 week courses only, no casual drumming classes** Beginners drumming @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall 5.30-6.30pm Experienced drumming @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall 7.30-8.30pm See you all on Tuesday! p.s If you are drummer, you can also do the dance course at the discounted rate.
